{
  "_meta": {
    "vocab": "regions",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "description": "Hypothalamic (and immediately adjacent) brain regions used by SYN4RCH. 'synonyms' exist for string matching only and carry no anatomical claim.",
    "allen_id_policy": "allen_id is the numeric Allen Mouse Brain Atlas / CCFv3 structure id. It is set ONLY where the curator is certain of the exact integer. The curator was not certain of ANY of them from memory, so every allen_id in this file is null. A wrong atlas id is worse than a missing one; these are to be filled from a downloaded copy of the Allen structure graph, not from recall. See docs/QUERIES.md."
  },
